-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("es",118,{
[3745]="70065DAC\n1\tDefeat Lhingar trappers (total: 8)\030Defeat Lhingar hunters (total: 8)\030Defeat Lhingar queen\tArlach has asked you to investigate Lhingar across the river to the north-west.\n2\tTalk to Arlach\tYou found the spider's nest in Lhingar and have defeated many spiders, including their queen. You should tell Arlach the news. Arlach is in Arnach.\n",
[3746]="7000887D\n1\tDefeat Cragstone-spiders (total: 10)\tThe Cragstone-spiders can be found in the crags west of Tol Ascarnen, beyond the tower Lugazag in the shadow of Dâr-gazag. Quartermaster Cynwiss asked you to defeat the Cragstone-spiders in the moors of the Steps of Gram.\n2\tReturn to Quartermaster Cynwiss at Tol Ascarnen\tQuartermast Cynwiss awaits your return at Tol Ascarnen. You made your way into the moors in the Steps of Gram and slaughtered a host of the Cragstone-spiders.\n",
[3747]="70022B2B\n1\tDerrota brazos reptantes (total: 20)\tPueden encontrarse brazos reptantes en el Laberinto del Gran Túmulo.\n",
[3748]="70047AE0\n1\tEnter the Towers of the Teeth\tThe Towers of the Teeth are located in the Slag-hills. You should defeat crawlers in the Towers of the Teeth.\n2\tDefeat crawlers in the Towers of the Teeth (total: 10)\tThe Towers of the Teeth are located in the Slag-hills. You should defeat crawlers in the Towers of the Teeth.\n3\tCompletado\tDefeated many crawlers in the Towers of the Teeth.\n",
[3749]="70047CF0\n1\tDefeat blighted marsh-lurkers (total: 2)\030Defeat scavenging crebain (total: 4)\030Defeat ravenous marsh-toads (total: 4)\030Derrota a los avanc de la Ciénaga de los Muertos (total: 2)\030Defeat swarming marsh-flies (total: 4)\030Defeat marsh corpse-flies (total: 4)\tCreatures from the Dead Marshes have ventured into the muddy border of the Noman-lands. You should destroy any of these creatures you find while scouting in the Noman-lands.\n2\tVuelve con Legolas\tLegolas can be found in the Camp of the Host, on the northern edge of North Ithilien. You should talk to Legolas and tell how you have cleansed many blighted creatures from the borders of the Dead Marshes.\n",
[3750]="70067EF1\n1\tCollect debts from sullen indebted workers ([según el diario]/5)\tUlanor instructed you to collect debts from five workers that are behind on their credit. Something seems off. The workers are in the nearby area.\n2\tSpeak with Foreman Nûrut\tThe worker expressed that there is no way that he could pay his debts and that he wanted you to speak with the foreman. You can find Foreman Nûrut in Rakhatâb.\n3\tSell the pearl to Elbatra in Rakhatâb\tThe foreman directed you to the shoreline surrounding Rakhatâb to search for a monstrous crab that defends a great treasure. Once you have recovered the treasure, you are to take it and sell it to a merchant with a penchant for very fine things in Rakhatâb.\n4\tDeliver the payment to Overseer Ulanor in Rakhatâb\tWith enough coin to pay the overseer you should return to her in western Rakhatâb and tell her that the worker's debts were paid in full.\n",
[3751]="70046C22\n1\tDefeat defilers along the Ephel Dúath (total: 8)\030Destroy Dúath-spires (total: 8)\tDefilers and Dúath-spires can be found along the edges of the Mountains of Shadow in south-eastern North Ithilien. Thurindol has asked you to defeat the defilers invading North Ithilien and destroy the black stone spires to which they are drawn.\n2\tTalk to Thurindol at Aelin Veren\tThurindol can be found at Aelin Veren. You have defeated the defilers and thrown down the Dúath-spires. You should return to Thurindol with news of your success.\n",
[3752]="7000A9DF\n1\tEntrega tus Emblemas del Valor a Hróar en Gath Forthnír\030Forja Emblemas del Valor (total: 5)\tHróar está en Gath Forthnír, en Angmar. Hróar te ha pedido que forjes algunas Emblemas del Valor y se las lleves.\n",
[3753]="7000A9D1\n1\tEntrega tus Emblemas de Vigilancia a Hróar en Gath Forthnír\030Forja Emblemas de Vigilancia (total: 5)\tHróar está en Gath Forthnír, en Angmar. Hróar te ha pedido que forjes algunos Emblemas de Vigilancia y se los lleves.\n",
[3754]="7000D4E4\n1\tDerrota a Iarvael\tLos merrevail cazan por todo Himbar, las tierras al oeste de Gath Forthnír. Thoriel te ha pedido que elimines a su lugarteniente, Iarvael, en las cuevas donde habitan.\n2\tHabla con Thoriel\tThoriel te espera en Gath Forthnír, el campamento de Montarances oculto al este de Himbar. Has derrotado a Iarvael y ahora debes volver a ver Thoriel con las noticias de tu victoria.\n",
[3755]="7006F086\n1\tStop looters (total: 6)\tBâdarul fears that Ekhamâti soldiers have escaped the fighting and made their way into the area. They are now looting and causing chaos and must be stopped.\n2\tReturn to Bâdarul in Iridír\tReturn to Bâdarul in Iridír and inform him that you have successfully dealt with the looters causing trouble in the area.\n",
[3756]="7002EB33\n1\tRecoge los bienes robados de los bandidos\tSe puede encontrar ganado y otros bienes robados en el campamento de los bandidos en el norte del Páramo. Debes liberar el ganado y recoger los bienes robados de los bandidos.\n2\tLibera el ganado de sus ataduras (total: 3)\030Recoge las monedas robadas de los bandidos (total: 6)\030Recoge el grano robado (total: 6)\tSe puede encontrar ganado y otros bienes robados en el campamento de los bandidos en el norte del Páramo. Debes liberar el ganado y recoger los bienes robados de los bandidos.\n3\tDevuelve los bienes robados a su legítimo propietario\tEl granjero está en su granja entre Largafortín y el campamento de los bandidos. Debes devolver los bienes robados al granjero, que es mucho más pobre después del robo de los bandidos.\n",
[3757]="7003081C\n1\tDerrota a Thauk\tHas escuchado a los orcos de Mordor pronunciar un nombre en particular, un nombre que solo puede pertenecer a su líder. Thauk se encuentra en lo profundo del campamento orco al sur de Walstow.\n2\tDerrota a Thauk\tThauk se encuentra en lo profundo del campamento orco al sur de Walstow.\n3\tCompletado\tHas derrotado a Thauk y has destruido el liderazgo de los orcos invasores de Mordor.\n",
[3758]="7006B767\n1\tEnter the village of Eshadûr\tDalagín, the Dumûri captain, has asked you to enter Eshadûr and disrupt the Ordâkhai operations there.\n2\tDefeat Ordâkhai in Eshadûr (total: 12)\030Destroy Ordâkhai boats (total: 4)\030Scout the western store-house\030Scout the eastern officers' tent\030Scout the southern stables\tDalagín, the Dumûri captain, has asked you to enter Eshadûr and destroy their boats, defeat Ordâkhai soldiers, and scout a few locations.\n3\tTalk to Dalagín in Iridír\tYou have completed your mission in Eshadûr and should return to Dalagín in Iridír.\n4\tTalk to Girhâzi\tYou have completed your mission there and reported back to Dalagín, the Dumûri captain, in Iridír. She has asked you to go to Girhâzi and tell her of the waggons laden with black powder.\n",
[3759]="70037160\n1\tYou should defeat the ambassadors from the Dunlending clans and the half-orcs.\t\n2\tDefeat Urig\030Defeat Brin\030Defeat Drustan\030Defeat Arwel\030Derrota a Thauk\tThe Dunlending and half-orc ambassadors may be found throughout the encampment at Torsbury. You should defeat the ambassadors from the Dunlending clans and the half-orcs.\n",
[3760]="7003EBE3\n1\tDerrota sapos en Tâl Bruinen (total: 10)\tHay sapos infestando las vías fluviales de Tâl Bruinen, en el Bosque de los Trolls. Mientras estés en Tâl Bruinen, deberías purgar las vías fluviales de los sapos repugnantes.\n",
[3761]="7006840C\n1\tCollect crocodile hides ([según el diario]/12)\030Collect crocodile meat ([según el diario]/12)\tDemand remains high for the trappings obtained by hunting crocodiles. Go to the shore east of the expedition camp, hunt the crocodiles for their hides and meat.\n2\tCollect crocodile hides ([según el diario]/12)\030Collect crocodile meat ([según el diario]/12)\tYou collected meat and hides from the crocodiles along the shore. Return them to Tevurin at the hunter's expedition camp in southeastern Cape of Umbar.\n",
[3762]="70068342\n1\tCollect crocodile underbelly skins ([según el diario]/6)\030Collect tough crocodile hides ([según el diario]/6)\tTevurin directed you to the shore south and east of the expedition camp in search of crocodile skins. He needs the soft underbelly skins and the tough hides from the backs of the crocodiles there.\n2\tDeliver the hides to Tevurin\tYou collected the soft underbelly and tougher hides of crocodiles. Take the hides and return to Tevurin at the hunter's expedition in the southeast of the Cape of Umbar.\n",
[3763]="700663A6\n1\tDiscover the Bolt-holes\tBrigands are stockpiling crossbow bolts in the Bolt-holes.\n2\tCollect quivers of crossbow bolts (total: 8)\tBrigands are stockpiling crossbow bolts in the Bolt-holes. Collect quivers of crossbow bolts.\n3\tTalk to Laerind\tYou have collected many quivers of crossbow bolts, and should deliver them to someone in Ethring. Deliver the crossbow bolts to someone in Ethring.\n",
[3764]="700332E6\n1\tInvoca a Svanr usando el cuerno de invocación cuando estés [según el diario] para partir\tEl cuerno de invocación se encuentra cerca del puente de Khazad-dûm, detrás de Svanr en Nud-melek. Debes invocar a Svanr a tu lado cuando estés listo para partir.\n2\tEncuentra un buen lugar para descansar (usa el cuerno para llamar a Svanr a tu lado)\tUn buen lugar para descansar probablemente se encuentra cerca de Sudulthurkh, el cruce norte de Nud-melek. Puedes invocar a Svanr usando el cuerno que te dio. Debes dirigirte hacia el este a través de Nud-melek, pasando al norte del gran abismo.\n3\tHabla con Svanr en Sudulthurkh\tSvanr se encuentra en el cruce de Sudulthurkh, en el noreste de Nud-melek. Debes hablar con Svanr.\n",
[3765]="7004186B\n1\tTravel south to Aerthir\tAerthir can be found far to the south of Ost Anglebed in Lebennin. Nimithil has asked you to aid the people of Aerthir and seek out a strange man taking refuge in the settlement.\n2\tTalk to the strange man in Aerthir\tThe strange man can be found somewhere in Aerthir. You have arrived in Aerthir and should now seek the strange man that dwells there.\n",
[3766]="70020BAC\n1\tHabla con un Montaraz en Echad Idhrenfair\tHay Montaraces en Echad Idhrenfair, al noreste del cadáver del venado. Deberías llevar la cornamenta que has conseguido a uno de los Montaraces de la Compañía Gris.\n",
[3767]="7006EB91\n1\tSpeak with Surâsh in southern Imhûlar\tSpeak with Surâsh at the site of the missing scouts. The site can be found south-east of Urmâkh, near Zahûmakh.\n2\tScout the area south-east near Zahûmakh for signs of the scouts\tScout the area around Zahûmakh to the south-east where the scouts were last seen.\n3\tExamine the first scout\030Examine the second scout\030Examine the third scout\tExamine the scouts for clues of the cause of their untimely end.\n4\tFind the first clue as to the scouts' death\030Find the second clue as to the scouts' death\030Find a third clue as to the scouts' death\tExamine the area around the scouts for more clues as to their demise, and their assailants.\n5\tExamine the strange banner nearby\tExamine the strange banner near the scouts.\n6\tCollect the strange banner\tCollect the strange banner.\n7\tSpeak with Surâsh in southern Imhûlar\tSpeak with Surâsh in southern Imhûlar.\n8\tBring the clues and banner to Mizâdi in Urmâkh\tBring the clues and banner to Mizâdi in Urmâkh.\n",
[3768]="70025A7D\n1\tMira alrededor\030Escala al pico del Coloso\tLa cuerda para escalar el Coloso está cerca. Sube a la cima del Coloso y mira alrededor.\n2\tHabla con Sardan, cerca del Coloso\tSardan está en la base del Coloso. Sardan estará interesado en escuchar lo que has visto.\n",
[3769]="70050A17\n1\tDisarm Ungoladan-traps\tCrude traps have been hidden around Óinsbridge.\n2\tDisarm Ungoladan-traps (total: 10)\tCrude traps have been hidden around Óinsbridge by the Ungoledain. They should be disarmed in order to allow safe passage for travelling dwarves.\n3\tCompletado\tYou have disarmed many traps at Óinsbridge.\n",
[3770]="70028C9F\n1\tLlévale la cruel púa a Garrun en el Valle del Isen\tGarrun está en su campamento, al oeste de Cuvnerth. Debes llevarle la cruel púa a Garrun.\n",
[3771]="70035679\n1\tDestruye las hachas orcas (total: 8)\tLos leñadores de Isengard se encuentran en el suroeste del Bosque Funesto cerca del Prado de Finglas. Barbamusgo te ha pedido que rompas las hachas crueles de los orcos en el Bosque Funesto para evitar que los árboles y los suyos sufran más daño.\n2\tHabla con Barbamusgo\tBarbamusgo se encuentra siguiéndote, o si os habéis separado, puedes llamarlo con tu silbato. Has derrotado a muchos orcos y destruido sus viles herramientas. Ahora deberías hablar con Barbamusgo y ver si tiene más tareas para ti.\n",
[3772]="7002C2D2\n1\tDestruye las trampas prohibidas (total: 8)\tLas trampas colocadas por los cazadores de Stangard se encuentran en el extremo noroeste del bosque de Thinglad. Debes destruir las trampas, ya que no están permitidas en las tierras de los Elfos.\n2\tRegresa con Noriel en Haldirith\tNoriel te espera en la fortaleza élfica de Haldirith, en Thinglad. Debes volver con Noriel, ahora que has destruido las trampas colocadas ilegalmente.\n",
[3773]="70027257\n1\tDestruye las trampas de orcos en el sur del Bosque de las Tumbas (total: 5)\tAndreg te ha pedido que lo ayudes a encontrar y desarmar las trampas de orcos por todo el sur del Bosque de las Tumbas.\n2\tHabla con Andreg\tDeberías hablar con Andreg sobre las trampas que desarmaste.\n",
[3774]="70018F81\n1\tLleva las armas orcas a Maethoron\030Recoge armas orcas (total: 5)\tLos orcos han establecido tres campamentos a lo largo del camino que atraviesa Nanduhirion, al noroeste de Talan Haldir. Se pueden encontrar armeros en estos campamentos. Maethoron te ha pedido que robes armas orcas de los campamentos de los orcos en Nanduhirion.\n",
[3775]="7002272A\n1\tDerrota a Brathach\030Derrota a Gogulch\030Derrota a Glewlûd\030Derrota a Tuisog\tLos thanes de los gigantes se encuentran en las ruinas del extremo sur del Valle de Thrór. Frithgeir te ha pedido que busques y derrotes a cada uno de los thanes de Gunnberg.\n2\tHabla con Frithgeir en Zudrugund\tFrithgeir está en Zudrugund, al norte de las ruinas de los gigantes. Deberías llevar la noticia de tu victoria a Frithgeir.\n",
[3776]="70053F21\n1\tRepair crumbling ramparts in Díngarth (total: 10)\tDíngarth's crumbling ramparts are in need of repair.\n2\tTalk to Gelvira\tGelvira can be found in Díngarth. You should talk to Gelvira.\n",
})
